From b7d5e93a71ec8918281531382ddd3b439fc7b7c0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sriman Achanta <achantass25@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Apr 2026 20:08:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] hwdb: Add extended SteelSeries Arctis headset device support
 (#41628)

Add USB device IDs for additional SteelSeries Arctis headset models to
the sound card hardware database.

Newly added device IDs:

- Arctis Nova 7x v2 (22AD)
- Arctis Nova 7 Diablo IV (22A9)
- Arctis Nova 7X (22A4)
- Arctis Nova 7X (22A5)
- Arctis Nova 7P V2 (22A7)

(cherry picked from commit 765416cae6129b23ef108e19d0d41f8f59788019)

Related: RHEL-72703
---
 hwdb.d/70-sound-card.hwdb | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/hwdb.d/70-sound-card.hwdb b/hwdb.d/70-sound-card.hwdb
index 4c53a861ec..03a0a5eefc 100644
--- a/hwdb.d/70-sound-card.hwdb
+++ b/hwdb.d/70-sound-card.hwdb
@@ -69,6 +69,11 @@ usb:v1038p227A*
 usb:v1038p22A1*
 usb:v1038p227E*
 usb:v1038p229E*
+usb:v1038p22AD*
+usb:v1038p22A9*
+usb:v1038p22A4*
+usb:v1038p22A5*
+usb:v1038p22A7*
 usb:v1038p12E0*
 usb:v1038p12E5*
  SOUND_FORM_FACTOR=headset
